00:29:36.220 --> 00:29:42.800
Yeah. You're trying, especially in that part with the Medusa heads, you're trying to go over, you know, pitfalls and other areas.

00:29:42.800 --> 00:29:47.000
And the Medusa head could hit you in a wrong spot, knock you back.

00:29:47.000 --> 00:29:49.120
