00:29:54.500 --> 00:29:56.280
So yeah, like heads are dense.

00:29:56.500 --> 00:30:01.300
Like if you get hit by a head that's flying through the air, you're probably going to get the wind knocked out of you.

00:30:01.400 --> 00:30:06.180
