00:30:07.060 --> 00:30:08.620
Always throwing back the 10 yard fight.

00:30:09.020 --> 00:30:09.920
You know, why not?

00:30:10.060 --> 00:30:16.060
Game number one. And so you may, you know, if you make it through the knockback thing, which is incredibly annoying.

